108
00:04:02,764 --> 00:04:06,444
If accepted, they received further instructions.

109
00:04:06,624 --> 00:04:09,821
Ford reportedly favored buyers who would drive

110
00:04:09,821 --> 00:04:11,976
the car rather than treat it as

111
00:04:11,976 --> 00:04:13,088
a status symbol,

112
00:04:13,088 --> 00:04:16,355
