115
00:04:19,786 --> 00:04:22,607
Car Showroom said Ford began with five

116
00:04:22,607 --> 00:04:25,799
hundred cars, then doubled to one thousand,

117
00:04:25,799 --> 00:04:28,471
then added three hundred fifty more.

118
00:04:28,651 --> 00:04:30,998
When the extra cars were announced,

119
00:04:30,998 --> 00:04:34,150
