120
00:04:34,150 --> 00:04:36,766
of November to the seventh of December.

121
00:04:36,946 --> 00:04:38,901
Demand, the outlet said,

122
00:04:38,901 --> 00:04:41,426
was out of control all over the

123
00:04:41,426 --> 00:04:41,915
world.

124
00:04:42,265 --> 00:04:44,076
Why go to all this trouble?

125
00:04:44,256 --> 00:04:47,137
Look at what happened with the first-generation

126
00:04:47,137 --> 00:04:47,321
GT.

127
00:04:47,501 --> 00:04:50,365
Wikipedia says that when the two thousand

128
00:04:50,365 --> 00:04:51,552
five car arrived,

129
00:04:51,552 --> 00:04:54,207
some buyers paid more than one hundred

130
00:04:54,207 --> 00:04:57,071
thousand dollars above the sticker price,

131
00:04:57,071 --> 00:04:59,655
and the first production car was sold

132
00:04:59,655 --> 00:05:02,240
