133
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:04,266
fifty-seven thousand dollars.

134
00:05:04,446 --> 00:05:06,430
The extra money went to sellers,

135
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:07,174
not to Ford.

136
00:05:07,524 --> 00:05:08,692
In our reading,

137
00:05:08,692 --> 00:05:11,653
the application process for the new GT

138
00:05:11,653 --> 00:05:13,445
was a response to that.

139
00:05:13,625 --> 00:05:15,259
Ford could not stop demand,

140
00:05:15,259 --> 00:05:17,195
