142
00:05:19,494 --> 00:05:21,212
That is our interpretation,

143
00:05:21,212 --> 00:05:23,186
not an official Ford statement.

144
00:05:23,366 --> 00:05:26,709
But it explains why the second-generation GT

145
00:05:26,709 --> 00:05:28,532
came with so many rules.

146
00:05:28,882 --> 00:05:31,371
Jalopnik reported that the plan was to

147
00:05:31,371 --> 00:05:33,730
build two hundred fifty cars a year,

148
00:05:33,730 --> 00:05:36,612
but Ford built only one hundred thirty-eight

149
00:05:36,612 --> 00:05:38,971
for the twenty seventeen model year.

150
00:05:39,151 --> 00:05:42,732
Multimatic, the Canadian company that built the

151
00:05:42,732 --> 00:05:43,951
cars in Markham,

152
00:05:43,951 --> 00:05:46,999
Ontario, had never worked at that scale.

153
00:05:47,179 --> 00:05:49,952
So even approved buyers often had to

154
00:05:49,952 --> 00:05:50,337
wait.

155
00:05:50,687 --> 00:05:53,043
That means the real cost of a

156
00:05:53,043 --> 00:05:55,238
Ford GT also included time.

157
00:05:55,418 --> 00:05:57,743
Applying, waiting for an answer,

158
00:05:57,743 --> 00:06:00,142
and then waiting for a build slot

159
00:06:00,142 --> 00:06:02,613
at a factory that was building far

160
00:06:02,613 --> 00:06:04,357
fewer cars than planned.

161
00:06:04,537 --> 00:06:05,335
For a buyer,

162
00:06:05,335 --> 00:06:07,062
the question was not only,

163
00:06:07,062 --> 00:06:08,125
can I afford it.

164
00:06:08,305 --> 00:06:09,131
It was also,

165
00:06:09,131 --> 00:06:10,508
will Ford choose me,

166
00:06:10,508 --> 00:06:12,229
and how long will I wait.

167
00:06:12,579 --> 00:06:13,972
Here is the twist.

168
00:06:14,152 --> 00:06:17,293
Choosing buyers is not only about rewarding

169
00:06:17,293 --> 00:06:17,658
fans.

170
00:06:17,838 --> 00:06:19,324
It protects the brand.

171
00:06:19,504 --> 00:06:21,871
A car that is driven at events,

172
00:06:21,871 --> 00:06:23,780
on tracks, and in public,

173
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:25,460
by people who love it,

174
00:06:25,460 --> 00:06:28,439
is better publicity than one sitting in

175
00:06:28,439 --> 00:06:30,348
a speculator's warehouse.

176
00:06:30,528 --> 00:06:32,409
And that leads us to the contract.

177
00:06:32,759 --> 00:06:36,017
Autoblog reported that buyers approved for the

178
00:06:36,017 --> 00:06:38,709
first five hundred Ford GTs agreed not

179
00:06:38,709 --> 00:06:41,826
to resell their cars for twenty-four months.

180
00:06:42,006 --> 00:06:43,179
The goal was simple.

181
00:06:43,359 --> 00:06:45,812
Stop flippers from buying a car at

182
00:06:45,812 --> 00:06:48,771
