184
00:06:49,710 --> 00:06:51,369
while real fans waited.

185
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,849
Then John Cena,

186
00:06:52,849 --> 00:06:54,582
the wrestler and actor,

187
00:06:54,582 --> 00:06:57,218
