198
00:07:21,293 --> 00:07:24,686
Autoblog said, and in February twenty eighteen

199
00:07:24,686 --> 00:07:26,972
he asked a judge to dismiss the

200
00:07:26,972 --> 00:07:27,340
case.

201
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:29,162
In June twenty eighteen,

202
00:07:29,162 --> 00:07:31,419
the case was settled out of court

203
00:07:31,419 --> 00:07:33,198
for an undisclosed amount.

204
00:07:33,378 --> 00:07:35,995
Cena's lawyers said Ford would donate that

205
00:07:35,995 --> 00:07:37,116
