206
00:07:37,296 --> 00:07:39,884
Cena said, I love the Ford GT

207
00:07:39,884 --> 00:07:41,847
and apologize to Ford.

208
00:07:42,198 --> 00:07:44,305
So the real cost of a Ford

209
00:07:44,305 --> 00:07:46,737
GT included something unusual.

210
00:07:46,917 --> 00:07:48,392
Your freedom to sell it.

211
00:07:48,572 --> 00:07:49,589
For two years,

212
00:07:49,589 --> 00:07:52,134
the car was legally yours to drive,

213
00:07:52,134 --> 00:07:53,297
but not to flip.

214
00:07:53,477 --> 00:07:54,647
For most owners,

215
00:07:54,647 --> 00:07:55,671
that was fine.

216
00:07:55,851 --> 00:07:58,534
For anyone hoping for a quick profit,

217
00:07:58,534 --> 00:08:00,855
