404
00:15:25,633 --> 00:15:28,222
Buying a Ford GT as an investment

405
00:15:28,222 --> 00:15:28,928
is a bet,

406
00:15:28,928 --> 00:15:30,184
not a guarantee.

407
00:15:30,534 --> 00:15:32,565
There is also a hidden trade-off.

408
00:15:32,745 --> 00:15:34,852
The more an owner drives the car,

409
00:15:34,852 --> 00:15:36,896
the more the running costs rise,

410
00:15:36,896 --> 00:15:38,811
and the more value the car may

411
00:15:38,811 --> 00:15:40,152
