412
00:15:40,332 --> 00:15:43,258
So many owners face a strange choice.

413
00:15:43,438 --> 00:15:45,780
Enjoy the car and pay for it,

414
00:15:45,780 --> 00:15:48,606
or protect its value and barely use

415
00:15:48,606 --> 00:15:48,848
it.

416
00:15:49,028 --> 00:15:51,478
That tension is part of the real

417
00:15:51,478 --> 00:15:51,861
cost.

418
00:15:52,212 --> 00:15:54,206
Is there a cheaper way to own

419
00:15:54,206 --> 00:15:54,893
a Ford GT?

420
00:15:55,073 --> 00:15:58,464
The first-generation car is the obvious option.

421
00:15:58,644 --> 00:16:02,518
Wikipedia says Ford built four thousand thirty-eight

422
00:16:02,518 --> 00:16:05,425
of them, with a supercharged five point

423
00:16:05,425 --> 00:16:08,331
four liter V8 making five hundred fifty

424
00:16:08,331 --> 00:16:09,151
horsepower.

425
00:16:09,331 --> 00:16:12,843
AutoMonitor's estimate of about three hundred fifty

426
00:16:12,843 --> 00:16:16,080
thousand to four hundred fifty thousand dollars

427
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:17,113
is still a lot,

428
00:16:17,113 --> 00:16:18,835
but it is a fraction of a

429
00:16:18,835 --> 00:16:19,524
modern GT.

430
00:16:19,875 --> 00:16:21,779
And it has a very different character.

431
00:16:21,959 --> 00:16:25,097
The two thousand five GT was designed

432
00:16:25,097 --> 00:16:27,049
