433
00:16:27,049 --> 00:16:29,254
forty, with a big V8 and a

434
00:16:29,254 --> 00:16:30,527
manual gearbox.

435
00:16:30,707 --> 00:16:33,558
The twenty seventeen car is a carbon

436
00:16:33,558 --> 00:16:38,072
fiber, turbocharged, race-bred machine with a seven-speed

437
00:16:38,072 --> 00:16:40,923
automatic, according to Gear Patrol.

438
00:16:41,103 --> 00:16:43,967
Two very different experiences under the same

439
00:16:43,967 --> 00:16:44,285
name.

440
00:16:44,635 --> 00:16:47,374
And the special versions cost even more.

441
00:16:47,554 --> 00:16:50,809
Ford built Heritage editions in the famous

442
00:16:50,809 --> 00:16:53,057
Gulf racing colors of the G T

443
00:16:53,057 --> 00:16:53,522
forty.

444
00:16:53,702 --> 00:16:57,947
AutoMonitor's figure for second-generation Heritage editions is

445
00:16:57,947 --> 00:17:00,103
about one point two to one point

446
00:17:00,103 --> 00:17:01,585
eight million dollars.

447
00:17:01,765 --> 00:17:05,562
Again, these are estimates without cited sources.

448
00:17:05,912 --> 00:17:07,346
For most people,

449
00:17:07,346 --> 00:17:11,023
though, the realistic way to experience a

450
00:17:11,023 --> 00:17:12,907
Ford GT is at a show,

451
00:17:12,907 --> 00:17:14,700
a museum, or a race.

452
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:17,835
Ford built so few that most enthusiasts

453
00:17:17,835 --> 00:17:19,501
