456
00:17:23,909 --> 00:17:26,064
So why did Ford build a car

457
00:17:26,064 --> 00:17:27,821
that so few could buy?

458
00:17:28,001 --> 00:17:30,869
Because the GT was never about volume.

459
00:17:31,049 --> 00:17:34,202
Wikipedia says that in twenty sixteen,

460
00:17:34,202 --> 00:17:36,940
a Ford Chip Ganassi Racing GT won

461
00:17:36,940 --> 00:17:38,683
its class at Le Mans,

462
00:17:38,683 --> 00:17:41,421
exactly fifty years after the G T

463
00:17:41,421 --> 00:17:43,994
forty's nineteen sixty-six win.

464
00:17:44,174 --> 00:17:46,779
That result, and the story around it,

465
00:17:46,779 --> 00:17:48,962
was worth far more to Ford than

466
00:17:48,962 --> 00:17:50,722
the profit on a few cars.

467
00:17:51,072 --> 00:17:54,007
Gear Patrol reported that the GT's racing

468
00:17:54,007 --> 00:17:57,086
success even pushed Porsche to redesign its

469
00:17:57,086 --> 00:17:58,948
nine eleven R S R race car

470
00:17:58,948 --> 00:18:00,452
for twenty seventeen,

471
00:18:00,452 --> 00:18:02,887
moving the engine to the middle of

472
00:18:02,887 --> 00:18:03,459
the car.

473
00:18:03,639 --> 00:18:05,877
And in April twenty twenty-six,

474
00:18:05,877 --> 00:18:08,404
Ford reported that the GT Mark four

475
00:18:08,404 --> 00:18:12,014
lapped the Nürburgring Nordschleife in six minutes

476
00:18:12,014 --> 00:18:14,829
fifteen point nine seven seven seconds,

477
00:18:14,829 --> 00:18:17,211
the third fastest car ever there.

478
00:18:17,562 --> 00:18:19,431
So the cost of a Ford GT

479
00:18:19,431 --> 00:18:22,236
to Ford itself was a racing program,

480
00:18:22,236 --> 00:18:24,417
a small factory partnership,

481
00:18:24,417 --> 00:18:27,300
and years of careful control over who

482
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:28,312
got the cars.

483
00:18:28,492 --> 00:18:30,071
The return was a legend.

484
00:18:30,251 --> 00:18:33,234
And the application and contract were part

485
00:18:33,234 --> 00:18:35,081
of protecting that legend.

486
00:18:35,431 --> 00:18:37,684
So what is the real cost of

487
00:18:37,684 --> 00:18:38,519
a Ford GT?

488
00:18:38,699 --> 00:18:41,341
About four hundred fifty thousand to five

489
00:18:41,341 --> 00:18:43,404
hundred thousand dollars to buy,

490
00:18:43,404 --> 00:18:45,595
if Ford accepted your application.

491
00:18:45,775 --> 00:18:48,105
A contract that stopped you from selling

492
00:18:48,105 --> 00:18:49,096
it for two years.

493
00:18:49,276 --> 00:18:51,865
And, by AutoMonitor's estimates,

494
00:18:51,865 --> 00:18:56,316
