495
00:18:56,316 --> 00:18:57,691
a year to insure,

496
00:18:57,691 --> 00:19:00,038
maintain, fuel, and store it.

497
00:19:00,388 --> 00:19:02,185
But unlike most new cars,

498
00:19:02,185 --> 00:19:04,414
the Ford GT did not simply lose

499
00:19:04,414 --> 00:19:04,846
value.

500
00:19:05,026 --> 00:19:07,782
Hagerty valued a twenty twenty-two car at

501
00:19:07,782 --> 00:19:11,277
about seven hundred eighty-eight thousand dollars in

502
00:19:11,277 --> 00:19:13,025
January twenty twenty-six.

503
00:19:13,205 --> 00:19:15,541
For owners who followed the rules,

504
00:19:15,541 --> 00:19:18,083
the biggest cost was keeping the car,

505
00:19:18,083 --> 00:19:19,045
not buying it.

506
00:19:19,225 --> 00:19:21,292
And for the one owner who broke

507
00:19:21,292 --> 00:19:23,892
