510
00:19:27,986 --> 00:19:30,285
Money, to buy and maintain it.

511
00:19:30,465 --> 00:19:32,729
Time, to apply and wait.

512
00:19:32,909 --> 00:19:34,957
And freedom, because for two years you

513
00:19:34,957 --> 00:19:35,927
