514
00:19:36,107 --> 00:19:38,476
Most supercars only ask for the first.

515
00:19:38,656 --> 00:19:40,967
The Ford GT asked for all three,

516
00:19:40,967 --> 00:19:43,279
and that is exactly what made it

517
00:19:43,279 --> 00:19:43,857
special.

518
00:19:44,207 --> 00:19:46,140
So if you ever see a Ford

519
00:19:46,140 --> 00:19:47,300
GT on the road,

520
00:19:47,300 --> 00:19:49,001
remember what it took.

521
00:19:49,181 --> 00:19:52,101
An application that Ford had to approve,

522
00:19:52,101 --> 00:19:53,853
a wait for one of only a

523
00:19:53,853 --> 00:19:55,605
few hundred cars a year,

524
00:19:55,605 --> 00:19:57,868
a two-year promise not to sell,

525
00:19:57,868 --> 00:20:00,350
and tens of thousands of dollars a

526
00:20:00,350 --> 00:20:02,466
year just to keep it ready to

527
00:20:02,466 --> 00:20:02,904
drive.

528
00:20:03,255 --> 00:20:05,731
Would you sign a two-year contract to

529
00:20:05,731 --> 00:20:06,668
buy a Ford GT?

